WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.934
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:06.133
You're here.
"The Tonight Show," you made it.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:07.734
Let's get to some news.

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:10.501
Well, guys, today the U.S.
hit the debt ceiling,

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:11.968
which means
the federal government

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:13.868
can't borrow any more money.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.167
Yep.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:18.400
Right now the U.S.
is $31 trillion in debt.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.434
The country's
so strapped for cash,

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:21.901
George Santos is e-mailing
people

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.601
pretending to be
a Nigerian prince.

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.200
Trying.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.634
Also to make some extra money,

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:31.300
it's now called the Gillette
Mach3 Washington Monument.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.701
Which I think is...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:36.133
But Republicans say they won't
raise the debt ceiling

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:38.200
unless there are
drastic spending cuts.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.133
They even want us to switch our
nukes to store-brand uranium.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.534
I mean, come on.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:45.601
Today, Treasury Secretary
Janet Yellen said

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.300
extraordinary measures
are being taken

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.067
to keep the government's
bills paid.

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.133
Which explains why tonight Mitch
McConnell started an OnlyFans.

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:55.767
-Wow.

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:57.634
-That's right.
Everyone wants to chip in.

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.901
Today President Biden said he
was gonna have a garage sale,

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.801
but his garage is a crime scene,
so it's just like --

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:03.868
He can't --
[ Laughter, audience "oohs" ]

00:01:03.868 --> 00:01:05.601
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.801
Speaking of classified
documents,

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:11.634
former President Trump has now
claimed that he never took any,

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:14.200
just the empty folders
the documents were in

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.200
because they were
"cool keepsakes."

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:22.634
Yeah, because there's no cooler
keepsake than a manila folder.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.767
Yeah, it's like, that's --
"cool keepsakes."

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:26.334
Trump takes classified documents

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:28.501
the way we take shampoo
from our hotel rooms, like --

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:30.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.667
Always nice to pick up
a little reminder

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.534
from that time you were the
president of the United States.

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.834
The White House
has a gift shop, man.

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:38.200
I mean, you don't go around
grabbing stuff

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.968
like you're on "Supermarket
Sweep," you know?

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:42.033
Just taking stuff.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:43.901
In fairness, when Trump sees the
word classified,

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:46.234
he thinks it just means the
thing has been made more classy.

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:48.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:51.367
"That casino was a dump
'til I classified the joint.

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:53.567
And now, it's very classy."

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:55.601
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.467
People are talking about this --

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:59.968
Ukrainian President Zelenskyy
said that he isn't sure

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.567
if Vladimir Putin
is still alive.

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:04.033
[ Audience "oohs" ]

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:05.334
Right now, 20 Russian officials

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.801
are sitting around a conference
table like,

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:07.701
"You poke him."

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:08.601
"No, you."

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:11.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:14.167
Then an aide felt
Putin's forehead, he's like,

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.334
"He's cold and stiff,
so all good. He's great."

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:19.334
[ Laughter ]
You guys see this?

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:20.934
At JFK airport here in New York,

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.133
a JetBlue plane

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:24.100
accidentally bumped into
another JetBlue plane

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.601
that was parked on the runway.

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:28.734
Everyone's okay, and JetBlue
has even released an apology.

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:30.868
Here it is.
-We here at JetBlue

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:33.200
would like to apologize
for our recent misstep.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.868
We take the safety of our
passengers very seriously,

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:38.567
and this kind of careless
accident will not be tolerated.

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:40.234
But look on the bright side.

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:41.601
At least we aren't Spirit.

00:02:41.601 --> 00:02:43.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:44.734
-Wow.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.234
[ Applause ]

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:49.400
-Wow. And that's --
-Indeed.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.200
[ Applause ]

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.067
-Then -- Then Spirit
saw JetBlue's video,

00:02:54.067 --> 00:02:55.934
and released their own response.

00:02:55.934 --> 00:02:58.133
Check this out.
-We here at Spirit

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.334
don't appreciate
the baseless finger-pointing

00:03:00.334 --> 00:03:03.167
and mudslinging that certain
airlines find acceptable.

00:03:03.167 --> 00:03:05.200
We promise to never
sink to their level,

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.834
because at the end of the day,

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:09.367
at least we aren't Southwest.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:12.167
-This is -- This is --

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:13.234
I can't believe they did that.

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.367
Well, Southwest
saw Spirit's video.

00:03:15.367 --> 00:03:16.634
-Really?

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:18.567
-And they released their own.
Watch this.

00:03:18.567 --> 00:03:20.100
-We here at Southwest understand

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.200
the criticism
we've recently received.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.033
Do we make mistakes? Sure.

00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:25.567
But when all is said and done,

00:03:25.567 --> 00:03:26.934
at least we aren't Southwest.

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:28.634
Wait, no!
-That -- Well --

00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:30.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:32.567
[ Rim shot ]

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:35.501
[ Cheers ]

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.300
Hey, I just saw
that Instagram just announced

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.267
a new feature called
"Quiet Mode,"

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:43.767
which helps users focus

00:03:43.767 --> 00:03:46.534
by pausing all notifications
from the app.

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:48.267
Yeah, here's how it works.

00:03:48.267 --> 00:03:49.834
You set your Instagram
to Quiet Mode.

00:03:49.834 --> 00:03:51.634
Then a friend texts you,
"Hey, did you see that thing

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:54.734
I sent you on Instagram?"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:58.033
Some more business news, Party
City just filed for bankruptcy.

00:03:58.033 --> 00:03:59.467
[ Audience "aws" ]

00:03:59.467 --> 00:04:02.100
Yeah, apparently they just
couldn't keep up with inflation,

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.567
weak sales,
and the rising price of helium.

00:04:04.567 --> 00:04:05.868
It is tough news.

00:04:05.868 --> 00:04:07.200
Let's take
a look at how it's going

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.968
over at Party City headquarters.

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:13.100
[ High-pitched ] Well, Dale,
looks like the end of the road.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.033
The price of helium's
just way too high.

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:16.267
-[ High-pitched ]
It's terrible, Doug.

00:04:16.267 --> 00:04:18.000
When I heard the news,
I shrieked.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:18.968
-It's not your fault.

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:20.367
I mean, we expanded too fast,

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:21.601
and it all just went pop.

00:04:21.601 --> 00:04:23.767
-And now, it's all coming
to a screeching halt.

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:26.234
-Well, I guess
we can't do this anymore.

00:04:26.234 --> 00:04:29.000
[ Hissing, knob squeaks ]

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.701
[ Deep voice ] It's a sad day.

00:04:30.701 --> 00:04:32.734
[ Laughter ]
-[ Deep voice ] I'm devastated.

00:04:32.734 --> 00:04:35.300
-I was waiting for a special
occasion to do this, but --

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.267
-Is that a cigar?
-Sure.

00:04:37.267 --> 00:04:38.834
-Wait, no!

00:04:38.834 --> 00:04:41.334
[ Explosion ]
-Oh, terrible. Oh.

00:04:41.334 --> 00:04:42.534
[ Applause ]

00:04:42.534 --> 00:04:44.267
That's unfort-- terrible.

00:04:44.267 --> 00:04:46.534
[ Laughs ] What?

00:04:46.534 --> 00:04:47.834
-Wow.
-Wow!

00:04:47.834 --> 00:04:49.501
-They were blonde?
-Oh, terrible.

00:04:49.501 --> 00:04:51.767
-They were all blonde?
-Oh, my goodness.

00:04:51.767 --> 00:04:53.834
It's Party City, man.

00:04:53.834 --> 00:04:55.000
What are you talking about?
Of course.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.667
-And helium suddenly
became flammable?

00:04:56.667 --> 00:04:58.734
-Yes, helium's flammable,
very, yeah.

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:01.434
Switching gears, PetSmart
is offering to pay

00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:04.434
one dog and one cat $10,000

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:07.334
to serve
as the chief toy tester.

00:05:07.334 --> 00:05:08.834
Pretty exciting opportunity.

00:05:08.834 --> 00:05:10.801
Here's what some pets had to say
when they heard the news.

00:05:10.801 --> 00:05:11.834
This dog said...

00:05:14.734 --> 00:05:15.934
This next dog said...

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.501
And finally, this cat said...

00:05:38.267 --> 00:05:43.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.200
Chief toy tester.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.133
Some movie news,
James Cameron said

00:05:47.133 --> 00:05:48.701
that in
the next "Avatar" sequel,

00:05:48.701 --> 00:05:50.968
the narrator
will no longer be Jake Sully,

00:05:50.968 --> 00:05:52.334
but someone else.

00:05:52.334 --> 00:05:54.868
Well, they're trying out
new narrators now,

00:05:54.868 --> 00:05:56.567
and we got a sneak peek
of the auditions.

00:05:56.567 --> 00:05:58.968
Yep, there's some familiar faces
here. Here. Check this out.

00:05:58.968 --> 00:06:02.467
-Look at those blue guys horsing
around in the swimming hole.

00:06:02.467 --> 00:06:04.400
You know, I went to
a high school with a Na'vi.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.367
We called him Bluey.
He was 10 feet tall.

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:09.033
Took our basketball team
to the states,

00:06:09.033 --> 00:06:11.300
but we got disqualified
because of his gills.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.200
-Wow! Oh, gosh, these fish.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.400
They're trying to murder me.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.934
-The connection between these
here Na'vi and the water

00:06:20.934 --> 00:06:22.934
is profound and stirring.

00:06:22.934 --> 00:06:25.834
Much like marmalade
on a warm biscuit.

00:06:25.834 --> 00:06:27.300
-Wow-e-wow.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.968
I can not believe the amazing
scenery and "Na'veye" people.

00:06:31.968 --> 00:06:33.734
Like for part two.

00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:38.534
-The Na'vi swim peacefully
underwater as they wonder --

00:06:38.534 --> 00:06:40.834
"Where are the [bleep]
penguins?"

00:06:42.501 --> 00:06:44.234
-What?
"Where are the penguins?"

00:06:44.234 --> 00:06:49.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:49.033 --> 00:06:52.467
Oh, I heard that in an effort
to reduce methane emissions,

00:06:52.467 --> 00:06:55.868
one dairy company is putting
masks and diapers on cows

00:06:55.868 --> 00:06:58.267
to trap their flatulence
and burps.

00:06:59.501 --> 00:07:00.667
Someone definitely
suggested this

00:07:00.667 --> 00:07:01.834
right after the boss was like,

00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:04.033
"Remember, there are
no dumb ideas, okay?"

00:07:04.033 --> 00:07:06.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:06.334 --> 00:07:08.734
And finally, a new study found
that men who use Viagra

00:07:08.734 --> 00:07:10.934
are more likely to live longer.

00:07:10.934 --> 00:07:13.167
The worse part,
Joe Biden is using the news

00:07:13.167 --> 00:07:15.467
to reassure everyone
that he can serve another term.

